// flickos-software: fetch Debian's 64x64 app icons with the DEP-11 catalog
// (the appstream package defines the target in 50appstream and leaves it
// off). Software shows them; the catalog's own icon addresses are not served
// any more. About 7 MB when Debian changes them, 12 MB unpacked.
Acquire::IndexTargets::deb::DEP-11-icons::DefaultEnabled "true";
